{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows首次出现可移动设备。对应需求：初始访问。官方：First Time Seen Removable Device。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.registry-*","winlogbeat-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows首次出现可移动设备","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows首次出现可移动设备\n\n### 为何重要\n首次进入主机或服务\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://winreg-kb.readthedocs.io/en/latest/sources/system-keys/USB-storage.html","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/drivers/usbcon/usb-device-specific-registry-settings"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"0859355c-0f08-4b43-8ff5-7d2a4789fc08","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 初始访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 初始访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"event.category:\"registry\" and host.os.type:\"windows\" and registry.value:\"FriendlyName\" and registry.path:*USBSTOR*\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1091","name":"Replication Through Removable Media","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1091/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1052","name":"Exfiltration Over Physical Medium","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1052/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1052.001","name":"Exfiltration over USB","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1052/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0010","name":"Exfiltration","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0010/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["registry.path"],"history_window_start":"now-7d","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":215,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
